\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, the Conqueror, reigns,
\par In glorious strength arrayed;
\par His kingdom over all mountains,
\par And bids the earth be glad.
\par Ye sons of men, rejoice
\par In Jesu's mighty love;
\par Lift up your heart, lift up your voice,
\par To Him who rules above.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Extol His kingly power,
\par Kiss the exalted Son,
\par Who died;and lives, to die no more,
\par High on His father's throne;
\par Our advocate with God,
\par He undertakes our cause,
\par And spread through all the earth abroad,
\par The victory of His Cross.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Courage! your Captain cries,
\par Who all your toil foreknew
\par Toil ye shall have; yet all despise,
\par I have o'ercome for you.
\par This is the victory
\par Before our faith they fall;
\par Jesus hath died for you and me;
\par Believe, and conquer all!
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

